stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Running: create or load DATA-009
    Running --> Running: decision + successful observation
    Running --> Recovering: retryable failure / dead end / provider failure
    Recovering --> Running: retry, fallback, replan or reconciled commit succeeds
    Recovering --> Escalated: permanent failure or unresolved ambiguous write
    Running --> Completed: completion invariants pass
    Running --> Cancelled: cancellation observed
    Running --> TerminatedGuard: any independent budget exhausted
    Recovering --> TerminatedGuard: failure/retry/replan/time budget exhausted
    Running --> Checkpointed: atomic checkpoint after accepted transition
    Checkpointed --> Running: same process continues
    Checkpointed --> Resumed: later process validates checksum and resumes
    Resumed --> Running
    Completed --> [*]
    Escalated --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
    TerminatedGuard --> [*]
